            "review_title": "Review at Jollybee, Aeon Mall, Hanoi",
            "review_text": "fionakyrkou\nMelbourne, Australia118 contributions\n0\nQuick and tasty lunch option\nApr 2025 • Couples\nGreat place for a quick lunch. Spaghetti and meat balls with fried chicken appeared to be the most popular order.\nSpaghetti, not bad, meat ball was really sliced sausage, and the sauce was quite sweet. Not bad but nothing to write home about.\nFried chicken...delicious. Better than KFC in my opinion. Very hot, very fresh, VERY crunchy. Would definitely go back just for the chicken.\nConsiderably cheap, AU$10 for 2 serves of Spaghetti & meat balls, 2 serves of chicken and 2 drinks. Great value.\nRestaurant was clean and tidy.\nWould recommend.\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2025",
